== Description ==
Increases source profits based on idle bonus and pet level. Autoclicks 1 times per second for 50% profit with 20% crit chance for 900% increased profit.

Gains [[Experience#Pet Experience|experience]] through his autoclicks, even when offline.

This undead creature is the frequent accomplice of the [[Necromancer]], as it supports the [[Idle Mode|idle style]] really well.

== Pet Abilities ==


Autoclicks once per second:
* <math>\text{Click Profit} = \frac{\text{Hero Click Profit}}{2}</math>
* <math>\text{Crit Chance} = 20\%</math>
* <math>\text{Crit Profit} = 900\%</math>


Multiplies profits by:
<br><math>\frac{L}{5} \times \left(1 + 30^{0.6875\log_{10}(I)} \times T \times \left(P^{0.6} + 1\right)\right) + 1</math>

''Note:''<math>30^{0.6875\log_{10}(I)} \approx I^{1.0155}</math>

where:
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>
* <math>I = 1 + \frac{\text{Idle Profit Bonus}\%}{100}</math>
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power}</math>
* <math>T = \text{Pet Time, in Hours}</math>
After 14 days:
* <math>T = 336 + (\text{Pet Time, in Hours} - 336)^{0.5}</math>


== Experience Gain ==
Zombie gains experience each time it autoclicks, and each second while [[Idle Mode]] is active:
<br><math>(0.5 + F) \times M</math>
<br>where:
* <math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus}</math>
* <math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier}</math>

